{"resourceIdentifier":"2367","resourceName":"Afforestation in Eucalyptus and Acacia plantations for Burapha Agroforestry Co., Ltd.","description":"The proposed VCS grouped project “Afforestation in Eucalyptus and Acacia plantations for Burapha Agroforestry Co., Ltd.”, represents one of the first major afforestation projects of the private sector in Lao PDR. It promotes and implements afforestation of Eucalyptus and Acacia agroforestry plantations on degraded areas. These areas are either privately owned, village owned or part of governmental “Production Forest Areas”, which entirely are degraded by swidden agriculture for rice cropping by local communities. The plantations are established in the Prefecture of Vientiane and the Provinces of Vientiane, Xayabouly, and Saysomboun in Lao PDR. Local villagers are allowed to use the plantations for intercropping or grazing, which is part of the agroforestry approach of the project. The project generates GHG removals through tree and soil carbon sequestration. These credits are generated using the CDM methodology AR-ACM0003: “Afforestation and reforestation of lands except wetlands” (version 2). Burapha is also FSC certified and managed to plant successfully about 3,500 ha by 2020, contracted from 28 villages and plans to scale up its plantations to 15,000 ha by 2025. 20% of the total area which are set aside for conservation management. The main tree species of the project are the exotic species of Eucalyptus cumadulensis (98%) and acacia auriculiformis (2%). The rotation period is 7 years and during the first years the local farmers can do intercropping. Between years 3 to 7 cattle grazing is allowed on the plantation areas and in the years 3 and 4 the plantations get thinned out. After the first rotation the Eucalypts get coppiced and replanted after each second rotation. The project will generate average removals of 205 t CO2/ha. Over a crediting period of 20 years the project will generate 604,015 tCO2e and 30,201 tCO2/yr.","location":{"latitude":17.970000,"longitude":102.620000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-02-22","endExclusive":"2021-03-25","endInclusive":"2021-03-24"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2367"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Vientiane"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Burapha Agroforestry Co. Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Vientiane, Lao"},{"type":"string","value":"+8562095589250"},{"type":"string","value":"pieter.duplessis@buraphawood.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2367"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2367"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"44946"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":49917}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3536 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"TÜV NORD CERT GmbH"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"08/03/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 31/05/2016 - 30/05/2036"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=49334&IDKEY=miquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkf068031586","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Re